-⚙️ Built using NextJS, RainbowKit, Foundry, Wagmi, Viem, and Typescript.
+Locally we run **anvil as a fork of Base mainnet**. The fork copies Base state (the real USDC contract, its code, balances, and admin roles) on demand, but every transaction stays on your machine. Nothing is ever broadcast to Base.
 
